<SiteHeader page="the-onyx-standard.html" />

<section class="page-hero">
<div class="wrap">
<p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / The Onyx Standard</p>
<p class="eyebrow on-dark">The Onyx Standard</p>
<h1 class="display">Built behind the wheel. Held the same at every mile.</h1>
<div class="rule"></div>
<p class="lead">Onyx Executive Miami is a boutique chauffeur company, not a marketplace and not a franchise. One founder set the standard by driving it — and personally vets every chauffeur who carries it forward.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section-soft">
<div class="wrap split">
<div class="prose reveal">
<h2 class="h2">Why one standard matters.</h2>
<div class="rule"></div>
<p>Large networks route you to whichever vehicle is nearest. The result is uneven: a different stranger each time, a call center between you and the person driving. Onyx is built the other way around. The founder began by driving every trip, and as the network grows, holds each chauffeur to the same standard of safety, discretion, and presentation.</p>
<p>You work with one accountable partner — whoever is assigned, the standard is the same, and one person stands behind it.</p>
</div>
<div class="figure reveal">
<div class="kicker">Vetted.<br>Consistent.<br><em>Accountable.</em></div>
<p>English, Russian, Ukrainian, and Polish spoken. Licensed and insured. Certificate of insurance available on request.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section-dark">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="grid-head reveal" style="margin-bottom:32px">
<p class="eyebrow on-dark">The Standard, in Practice</p>
<h2 class="h2">Seven standards, held every time.</h2>
<div class="rule"></div>
<p class="lead">Not a slogan — what actually happens before, during, and after every ride.</p>
</div>
<div class="cards reveal">
<div class="card" style="cursor:default"><div class="no">01</div><h3>Chauffeur vetting</h3><p>Every chauffeur is personally vetted by the founder before joining the network — not outsourced to an app's background-check API.</p></div>
<div class="card" style="cursor:default"><div class="no">02</div><h3>Vehicle inspection</h3><p>The vehicle is checked before each shift — cleanliness, fuel, and condition confirmed before it's dispatched to you.</p></div>
<div class="card" style="cursor:default"><div class="no">03</div><h3>Trip briefing</h3><p>Your chauffeur is briefed on pickup details, passenger count, and any preferences on file before the ride begins.</p></div>
<div class="card" style="cursor:default"><div class="no">04</div><h3>Early staging target</h3><p>The chauffeur's target is to be staged and ready before your scheduled time, not arriving at it.</p></div>
<div class="card" style="cursor:default"><div class="no">05</div><h3>Proactive communication</h3><p>Delays, flight changes, or route adjustments are communicated to you directly — before you have to ask.</p></div>
<div class="card" style="cursor:default"><div class="no">06</div><h3>Confidentiality</h3><p>Unmarked vehicle, no detail about your trip repeated outside the booking.</p></div>
<div class="card" style="cursor:default"><div class="no">07</div><h3>Backup &amp; service recovery</h3><p>If the primary vehicle is unavailable, a vetted partner vehicle is arranged and confirmed with you before booking — never a surprise at pickup.</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section-soft">
<div class="wrap split center">
<div class="prose reveal">
<p class="eyebrow">What you can expect</p>
<h2 class="h2">The standard, summarized.</h2>
<div class="rule"></div>
<ul class="points">
<li><i class="mark"></i><span><b>A direct line.</b> Reach the person responsible for your transportation.</span></li>
<li><i class="mark"></i><span><b>Discretion.</b> Unmarked vehicles; nothing about your travel repeated.</span></li>
<li><i class="mark"></i><span><b>Punctuality.</b> Buffer built in; flight and traffic tracked.</span></li>
<li><i class="mark"></i><span><b>Consistency.</b> The same standard whether it's the founder or a vetted chauffeur.</span></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="feat-img portrait reveal"><picture><source type="image/avif" srcset="founder-walk.avif" /><img src="founder-walk.webp" alt="Vitalii, founder of Onyx Executive Miami" width="700" height="1052" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" /></picture></div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section-soft">
<div class="wrap split center">
<div class="feat-img portrait reveal"><picture><source type="image/avif" srcset="bag-handoff.avif" /><img src="bag-handoff.webp" alt="Onyx chauffeur personally handing a client her bag curbside in Miami" width="700" height="872" decoding="async" loading="lazy" /></picture></div>
<div class="prose reveal">
<p class="eyebrow">Personal, not procedural</p>
<h2 class="h2">Every handoff, done by hand.</h2>
<div class="rule"></div>
<p>No valet queue, no baggage cart, no waiting for someone else to bring your things. The chauffeur assigned to you carries your bags personally — from curb to cabin, and back again at the end of the ride.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="cta-band"><div class="wrap">
<h2 class="h2">Work with one trusted partner.</h2>
<p>Call or message — you'll deal with the person accountable for the ride, start to finish.</p>
<div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-light" href="tel:+17869316699">Call +1 786 931 ONYX (6699)</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="contact.html#book">Request a quote</a></div>
</div></section>
<SiteFooter />
<div class="mbar"><a href="tel:+17869316699">Call</a><a href="https://wa.me/17869316699?text=Hi%2C%20I%27d%20like%20a%20quote." target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp</a></div>
<YearReveal />
<SiteScripts />
</Base>
